ations infrastructure is not  crumbling but we are way behind where we  should be for a country of our wealth  look  our airports to some around the world  look at our highways to those in many  parts of the world and meanwhile our  president is sitting in a white and a  darkened White House sometimes in the  bunker below it on Friday night as DC  literally burns providing no leadership  no words of de-escalation nothing other  than self aggrandizement and threats to  protesters so I'm not literally saying  we are no longer a first world country  but more and more we're reacting to  events the way a less advanced country  would I want to hear from you about this  I will have more about it upcoming let  me know your thoughts on Twitter at D  Pakman remember to make sure you are  subscribed for free to the daily one  hour-long David Pakman show podcast on  whatever podcasting app you use
 

